==Description==
Adds the {{SpellTooltip|spell_name = Ritual Of Potency}} spell to your spellbook. On activation increase the amount of {{SpellTooltip|spell_name = Ritual Of Potency}} casts.

==Details==
The {{SpellTooltip|spell_name = Ritual Of Potency}} spell is available in your spellbook.

On activation, consumes all charges to increase {{SpellTooltip|spell_name = Ritual Of Potency}} casts by:

<math>C</math>

Each spell cast grants:

<math>(R \times 4)^2 \times 0.1 - 0.009</math>
<br>weapon charges.

where:
* <math>C = \text{Weapon Charges}</math>
* <math>R = \frac{1 + 0.75 \times \text{Tier}}{4}</math>

Tiers:
* <math>\text{Common} = 0</math>
* <math>\text{Uncommon} = 1</math>
* <math>\text{Rare} = 2</math>
* <math>\text{Epic} = 3</math>
* <math>\text{Legendary} = 4</math>
* <math>\text{Unique} = 4</math>

